(collections-d, batch D (night) - docs/ledger/collections-a.md rows
 LST-52, LST-55, LST-60 (folds LST-61), LST-62, LST-63, LST-64, LST-65,
 LST-66, LST-67, LST-69.

 Same convention as tests/440_gen_collections_c.vox: each leaf is called
 directly off a pinned rng seed with its emitted source printed in full,
 and each leaf is also emitted nested once, since 'gen join lines'
 renders a nested body (comma-joined) differently from a top-level one
 (period-joined) and that is exactly what a leaf's own gate has to prove
 survives rendering, not just "the idea" of the leaf (PROCEDURE.md 6a).

 The naming allocator is 'gen buffer name'/'gen buffer reference'/'gen
 buffer property'/'gen buffer companion' from gen_buffers.vox, the same
 pool batch C's own leaves use.)

Print "--- LST-52: a map value that is itself a list and a map ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf map value nested' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf map value nested' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- LST-55 (static half), LST-66: the predicate folds true on all six declared types ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf predicate static fold' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf predicate static fold' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- LST-60, folds LST-61: the four scalar type nouns on a mixed list, random order ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf predicate mixed dispatch' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf predicate mixed dispatch' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- LST-62, LST-55 (dynamic half): all six type nouns, one of each, random order ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf predicate all six match' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf predicate all six match' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

